-- over the hurdles, a lap of the stadium, the big feature a steep drop down the
-- fountain steps, S-bends through the gardens off a speed pad, the hairpin
-- under the castle, a drop down from the castle and another to the harbour,
-- S-bends along the waterfront off a second speed pad and the home straight; a
-- clock-tower start; in the Track and Field pack, not free; switched off until
-- Moses has watched the preview). It is added switched off: nobody can race on
